 - 2026-06-01: Held-out / cross-split validation of the dependency-aware weighting (fit the learned dependency structure on a FoVer train split, evaluate on a disjoint test split) — guard against overfitting the weighting before it can advance the frozen headline (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: dependency_aware_weighting_generalizes_heldout_headline_re_freeze_candidate_for_v337; results/experiment_3668_dependency_aware_weighting_heldout.json
